This crate is a Rust wrapper. It does not contain the native libslirp
implementation.

At build time libslirp-sys discovers a separately supplied native libslirp
version 4.2.0 or newer (or a native Windows library supplied through vcpkg) and
links it as `slirp`. Native libslirp is not vendored in this directory and is
not relicensed under MIT by this wrapper. Upstream native libslirp source:
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/slirp/libslirp
Native libslirp license: BSD-3-Clause.
